## Chlorine
component-chlorine = Chlorine
    .genitive = chlorine
component-chlorine-description-novice = A yellow-green gas with a sharp smell — the smell of bleach. Poisonous. It forms when current passes through salt water.
component-chlorine-description-school = Chlorine is 2.5 times heavier than air and collects low down. In small doses it disinfects swimming pools and tap water.
component-chlorine-safety-school = Poisonous: irritates eyes and lungs. Real electrolysis of salt water is done only with a small current, in a ventilated place or under a fume hood.
